1
00:01:35,710 --> 00:01:39,840
[Abyss]

2
00:03:15,340 --> 00:03:17,090
Have some water, kid.

3
00:03:17,090 --> 00:03:18,150
Thank you, Ms. Lin.

4
00:03:19,070 --> 00:03:19,890
Have a seat.

5
00:03:28,370 --> 00:03:30,870
You've grown into a fine young man.

6
00:03:32,340 --> 00:03:33,690
Your mother is blessed

7
00:03:33,870 --> 00:03:35,750
to have such an excellent child.

8
00:03:38,700 --> 00:03:40,579
If Dehua were still here,

9
00:03:40,620 --> 00:03:42,550
he'd definitely be better than me.

10
00:03:45,500 --> 00:03:46,980
Among all the neighbors,

11
00:03:49,120 --> 00:03:51,650
you're the only one
who still calls him Dehua.

12
00:03:52,150 --> 00:03:53,400
To everyone else...

13
00:03:57,680 --> 00:03:59,430
he was just a murderer.

14
00:04:04,170 --> 00:04:07,190
I've been dreaming
about Dehua a lot lately.

15
00:04:07,550 --> 00:04:09,210
Dreaming about our past.

16
00:04:10,130 --> 00:04:11,230
I miss him a lot too.

17
00:04:13,620 --> 00:04:14,880
I came today

18
00:04:14,910 --> 00:04:16,630
specifically to ask if you still have

19
00:04:16,630 --> 00:04:18,820
any of Dehua's old belongings.

20
00:04:19,140 --> 00:04:20,620
I'd like to take a look at them.

21
00:04:20,620 --> 00:04:22,890
Yes, I've kept them all.

22
00:04:22,920 --> 00:04:23,900
Come with me.

23
00:04:40,690 --> 00:04:41,630
Uncle,

24
00:04:42,140 --> 00:04:43,540
do you still remember me?

25
00:04:43,870 --> 00:04:45,170
I'm Li Cheng,

26
00:04:45,200 --> 00:04:46,630
Li Qingping's son.

27
00:04:58,010 --> 00:04:58,920
Cheng.

28
00:04:59,040 --> 00:04:59,990
Cheng.

29
00:05:00,370 --> 00:05:02,190
Dehua's things are all here.

30
00:05:04,650 --> 00:05:05,740
Ms. Lin,

31
00:05:05,760 --> 00:05:07,320
can I take them back with me to look at?

32
00:05:07,320 --> 00:05:09,140
I'll bring them back when I'm done.

33
00:05:09,140 --> 00:05:10,400
Go ahead and take them.

34
00:05:16,190 --> 00:05:21,280
[Episode 13]

35
00:06:28,340 --> 00:06:30,070
Dehua, how is it?

36
00:06:30,090 --> 00:06:31,160
Almost done.

37
00:06:38,990 --> 00:06:39,920
Alright.

38
00:06:42,640 --> 00:06:44,070
Here, have an ice pop.

39
00:06:44,090 --> 00:06:46,690
We'll go ride our bikes
when we're done eating.

40
00:06:47,900 --> 00:06:49,350
Dehua, Cheng.

41
00:07:30,510 --> 00:07:31,340
Boss,

42
00:07:31,790 --> 00:07:33,850
how soon can you develop this film?

43
00:07:33,870 --> 00:07:35,780
135 vintage film.

44
00:07:35,810 --> 00:07:36,740
Normally 3 days.

45
00:07:36,740 --> 00:07:38,010
I can't wait that long.

46
00:07:38,290 --> 00:07:39,300
Can you speed it up?

47
00:07:39,300 --> 00:07:40,080
I can pay extra.

48
00:07:40,080 --> 00:07:41,700
What are you thinking, bro?

49
00:07:41,750 --> 00:07:43,860
The development temperature
and the development time

50
00:07:43,860 --> 00:07:45,190
are fixed.

51
00:07:45,190 --> 00:07:46,250
It can't be rushed.

52
00:07:48,150 --> 00:07:50,450
I'm a police officer. It's for a case.

53
00:07:51,060 --> 00:07:52,050
[Police] [Li Cheng]

54
00:07:55,659 --> 00:07:56,500
Yes, Sir!

55
00:07:56,500 --> 00:07:58,640
Forty minutes. I guarantee it'll be done.

56
00:07:58,640 --> 00:07:59,420
Have a seat.

57
00:07:59,420 --> 00:08:00,550
Wait for me a moment.

58
00:08:05,720 --> 00:08:06,620
This half of the photo

59
00:08:06,620 --> 00:08:08,930
was found at Hu Xiaofei's death scene.

60
00:08:08,950 --> 00:08:10,570
It perfectly matches

61
00:08:10,570 --> 00:08:11,750
the half I saw

62
00:08:11,750 --> 00:08:13,360
in Han Pinmu's room,

63
00:08:13,360 --> 00:08:14,250
in terms of texture,

64
00:08:14,250 --> 00:08:15,120
fading,

65
00:08:15,120 --> 00:08:16,300
and background.

66
00:08:18,650 --> 00:08:21,060
But I found the original photograph

67
00:08:21,090 --> 00:08:22,860
at the house of Bi Dehua's mother,
Lin Guizhi.

68
00:08:22,860 --> 00:08:23,860
It proves that

69
00:08:23,890 --> 00:08:24,990
the so-called group photo

70
00:08:24,990 --> 00:08:26,280
is a composite.

71
00:08:28,290 --> 00:08:31,210
Have you verified
the authenticity of this photo?

72
00:08:31,360 --> 00:08:33,169
Is it possible that these 2 photos

73
00:08:33,169 --> 00:08:34,980
were taken around the same time?

74
00:08:35,000 --> 00:08:36,480
The original photograph

75
00:08:36,480 --> 00:08:37,580
was taken in 2003

76
00:08:37,580 --> 00:08:39,150
with a film camera.

77
00:08:39,169 --> 00:08:40,510
I've developed the negatives.

78
00:08:40,510 --> 00:08:41,900
I also asked Lin Guizhi.

79
00:08:41,919 --> 00:08:43,870
She said it was just a family trip.

80
00:08:43,900 --> 00:08:45,350
Just the three of them.

81
00:08:45,660 --> 00:08:47,530
And I've compared them carefully.

82
00:08:47,530 --> 00:08:48,290
Even the height

83
00:08:48,290 --> 00:08:49,940
of Bi Dehua's popped left collar

84
00:08:49,940 --> 00:08:50,980
matches perfectly.

85
00:08:50,980 --> 00:08:52,240
So it's 100% proof that

86
00:08:52,250 --> 00:08:54,250
this photo is a composite.

87
00:08:55,960 --> 00:08:58,620
What was Han Pinmu's motive

88
00:08:58,650 --> 00:09:00,110
for this composite photo?

89
00:09:01,830 --> 00:09:03,010
There are definitely

90
00:09:03,010 --> 00:09:04,410
more than just Han Pinmu

91
00:09:04,410 --> 00:09:06,340
and Hu Xiaofei in this group photo.

92
00:09:06,390 --> 00:09:08,150
The figure in the piece
Han Pinmu tore off and hid

93
00:09:08,150 --> 00:09:09,680
is definitely not Bi Dehua.

94
00:09:09,700 --> 00:09:10,500
It's the third person

95
00:09:10,500 --> 00:09:12,100
they really wanted to hide.

96
00:09:12,120 --> 00:09:13,670
Who this third person is

97
00:09:13,700 --> 00:09:15,300
should be our breakthrough.

98
00:09:19,940 --> 00:09:21,630
Take it to the Forensics Department
for appraisal.

99
00:09:21,630 --> 00:09:22,290
Okay.

100
00:09:23,750 --> 00:09:24,550
Li Cheng,

101
00:09:25,050 --> 00:09:27,480
Han Pinmu is quite willing
to play chess with the police,

102
00:09:27,480 --> 00:09:28,250
isn't he?

103
00:09:28,790 --> 00:09:29,590
Alright then.

104
00:09:30,370 --> 00:09:31,370
You keep playing with him.

105
00:09:31,370 --> 00:09:32,890
I want you to checkmate him

106
00:09:32,890 --> 00:09:33,980
while he's still alive!

107
00:09:33,980 --> 00:09:34,770
Understood?

108
00:09:34,940 --> 00:09:35,670
Understood!

109
00:10:29,430 --> 00:10:30,350
No!

110
00:10:42,510 --> 00:10:44,020
[Incoming Call: Li Guangwen]

111
00:10:48,010 --> 00:10:48,750
Guangwen.

112
00:10:49,270 --> 00:10:51,360
The forensics results are out.

113
00:10:51,360 --> 00:10:53,220
The group photo is indeed forged.

114
00:10:55,790 --> 00:10:58,190
That means Li Cheng's analysis is correct.

115
00:10:58,870 --> 00:10:59,770
Han Pinmu

116
00:10:59,770 --> 00:11:02,010
is indeed using a fake photo

117
00:11:02,010 --> 00:11:04,030
to cover up the existence
of a third person.

118
00:11:03,740 --> 00:11:04,630
[Huangshui County Public Security
Forensic Science Center]

119
00:11:04,650 --> 00:11:05,610
[Trace Examination
and Identification Report]

120
00:11:05,720 --> 00:11:07,530
But we have no idea where this person is

121
00:11:07,530 --> 00:11:09,940
or if they are dead or alive.

122
00:11:10,150 --> 00:11:11,120
What's more terrifying is that

123
00:11:11,120 --> 00:11:12,840
even though 8 years have passed,

124
00:11:12,840 --> 00:11:14,290
we can't be sure

125
00:11:14,500 --> 00:11:16,120
if he will strike again.

126
00:11:16,150 --> 00:11:17,770
But we found Bi Dehua's DNA

127
00:11:17,770 --> 00:11:19,960
at the crime scene.

128
00:11:20,080 --> 00:11:21,740
The evidence is irrefutable.

129
00:11:22,240 --> 00:11:23,030
Fan,

130
00:11:23,390 --> 00:11:26,210
what exactly are Han Pinmu,
Hu Xiaofei, Bi Dehua,

131
00:11:26,460 --> 00:11:27,860
and the third person

132
00:11:28,270 --> 00:11:30,010
up to?

133
00:11:34,830 --> 00:11:36,020
Is that okay?

134
00:11:40,400 --> 00:11:41,290
Are you okay?

135
00:11:42,330 --> 00:11:43,600
-Get up.
-It's fine.

136
00:11:43,600 --> 00:11:44,320
Careful.

137
00:11:44,340 --> 00:11:45,460
Careful. Careful.

138
00:11:46,430 --> 00:11:47,530
Don't step on the prints.

139
00:11:47,530 --> 00:11:48,590
Careful. Careful.

140
00:11:49,540 --> 00:11:50,870
Let's go outside first.

141
00:11:51,170 --> 00:11:52,770
Careful. Don't step on them.

142
00:11:58,550 --> 00:11:59,790
Sorry, Ling.

143
00:11:59,810 --> 00:12:01,410
I used a bit too much force just now.

144
00:12:01,410 --> 00:12:02,270
It's fine.

145
00:12:02,290 --> 00:12:03,790
We agreed to make it as real as possible.

146
00:12:03,790 --> 00:12:04,500
It's fine.

147
00:12:04,640 --> 00:12:06,170
You hit hard.

148
00:12:06,200 --> 00:12:07,890
That elbow nearly knocked me out.

149
00:12:07,890 --> 00:12:09,050
When I was in school,

150
00:12:09,100 --> 00:12:10,620
my combat grades were top 3.

151
00:12:10,620 --> 00:12:12,240
I was holding back just now.

152
00:12:12,450 --> 00:12:14,290
Alright, let's get started.

153
00:12:14,310 --> 00:12:16,470
Yang Feng, you're in charge
of taking photos.

154
00:12:16,470 --> 00:12:17,940
Everyone, please walk carefully.

155
00:12:17,940 --> 00:12:19,170
Don't ruin the traces at the scene.

156
00:12:19,170 --> 00:12:19,960
Okay.

157
00:12:19,980 --> 00:12:20,670
Here.

158
00:12:23,130 --> 00:12:24,370
Come, walk this way.

159
00:12:25,510 --> 00:12:26,390
Careful.

160
00:12:27,410 --> 00:12:28,400
A bit to the side.

161
00:12:49,590 --> 00:12:51,430
Come on, let's have a drink.

162
00:12:52,200 --> 00:12:54,360
This seems to be our first get-together

163
00:12:54,360 --> 00:12:56,160
since the task force was formed.

164
00:12:56,740 --> 00:12:57,700
Thank you all.

165
00:12:57,700 --> 00:12:59,570
I really caused you
a lot of trouble today.

166
00:12:59,570 --> 00:13:00,580
This meal is on me.

167
00:13:00,860 --> 00:13:01,630
-Thanks.
-Thanks.

168
00:13:01,630 --> 00:13:03,230
-Cheers!
-You're generous.

169
00:13:05,480 --> 00:13:07,510
We all became police officers late

170
00:13:07,620 --> 00:13:10,020
and had no prior contact
with the 3/12 Case.

171
00:13:10,220 --> 00:13:11,370
Today was my first time

172
00:13:11,370 --> 00:13:13,480
visiting the crime scene of the 3/12 Case.

173
00:13:13,480 --> 00:13:15,200
It was also my first time
reconstructing a crime scene

174
00:13:15,200 --> 00:13:17,050
after I became a police officer.

175
00:13:18,390 --> 00:13:19,360
It was too real.

176
00:13:19,960 --> 00:13:22,050
The moment I was pinned to the ground,

177
00:13:22,050 --> 00:13:25,240
the sheer powerlessness and fear

178
00:13:26,440 --> 00:13:27,740
were quite desperate.

179
00:13:29,770 --> 00:13:31,560
That's also what puzzles me.

180
00:13:31,740 --> 00:13:33,550
You are a trained police officer.

181
00:13:33,550 --> 00:13:34,500
Your physical fitness

182
00:13:34,500 --> 00:13:36,520
is much better than ordinary people's.

183
00:13:36,520 --> 00:13:38,280
Even you struggled to break free.

184
00:13:38,280 --> 00:13:39,380
How did Chen Chunli

185
00:13:39,410 --> 00:13:41,500
fight against the 3 suspects?

186
00:13:41,520 --> 00:13:43,320
Why did she still have the strength

187
00:13:43,320 --> 00:13:44,580
and chance to run to the highway

188
00:13:44,580 --> 00:13:46,640
for help after being stabbed 3 times?

189
00:13:47,140 --> 00:13:48,320
The file says

190
00:13:48,320 --> 00:13:50,950
the 3 suspects thought
Chen Chunli was dead

191
00:13:50,980 --> 00:13:52,080
and let their guard down.

192
00:13:52,080 --> 00:13:53,840
So she waited until they were far away

193
00:13:53,840 --> 00:13:55,150
before escaping.

194
00:13:55,740 --> 00:13:58,300
The suspects had never failed before.

195
00:13:58,810 --> 00:14:01,340
Why did they make such
a big mistake this time?

196
00:14:01,720 --> 00:14:03,520
Could it be because of that rock?

197
00:14:04,250 --> 00:14:05,890
Chen Chunli successfully fought back.

198
00:14:05,890 --> 00:14:07,620
They panicked and got anxious.

199
00:14:08,020 --> 00:14:10,550
Or they had a disagreement
among themselves.

200
00:14:10,620 --> 00:14:12,050
After all, there have been
no similar cases

201
00:14:12,050 --> 00:14:14,080
since this one.

202
00:14:15,620 --> 00:14:16,840
And the environment

203
00:14:17,080 --> 00:14:19,210
was more disruptive than we imagined.

204
00:14:19,910 --> 00:14:22,030
The sound of the wind and the water

205
00:14:22,320 --> 00:14:24,120
and the rugged mudflats

206
00:14:24,130 --> 00:14:25,600
could have an impact.

207
00:14:27,040 --> 00:14:29,230
Your analyses all make sense.

208
00:14:29,450 --> 00:14:31,060
But no matter what,

209
00:14:31,220 --> 00:14:33,050
I always feel that the Chen Chunli Case

210
00:14:33,050 --> 00:14:34,670
and the other cases

211
00:14:34,920 --> 00:14:37,250
bear both similarities and differences.

212
00:14:40,410 --> 00:14:43,220
Bear both similarities and differences?

213
00:14:43,420 --> 00:14:44,090
Right.

214
00:14:44,430 --> 00:14:45,860
I think the Chen Chunli Case

215
00:14:45,860 --> 00:14:48,220
only has the outward shell
of the previous cases.

216
00:14:48,220 --> 00:14:49,240
Three perpetrators.

217
00:14:49,240 --> 00:14:50,270
A triangular scraper.

218
00:14:50,270 --> 00:14:51,370
Extreme violence.

219
00:14:51,420 --> 00:14:52,910
But this marked their first slip‑up;

220
00:14:52,910 --> 00:14:54,310
they let the victim get away,

221
00:14:54,310 --> 00:14:55,770
leaving a fatal flaw.

222
00:14:55,820 --> 00:14:56,750
Logically,

223
00:14:56,750 --> 00:14:58,650
it was their 5th time
committing a crime.

224
00:14:58,650 --> 00:14:59,790
Compared to before,

225
00:14:59,860 --> 00:15:02,250
they should have had more experience.

226
00:15:02,370 --> 00:15:03,250
Chen Chunli is just

227
00:15:03,250 --> 00:15:04,940
a frail, ordinary woman.

228
00:15:04,960 --> 00:15:06,460
How could she escape

229
00:15:06,500 --> 00:15:07,700
from the wilderness?

230
00:15:08,150 --> 00:15:09,080
Besides,

231
00:15:09,130 --> 00:15:11,100
the crime scene was right by the river.

232
00:15:11,100 --> 00:15:12,760
If, as Chen Chunli said,

233
00:15:12,790 --> 00:15:14,440
the suspects let their guard down

234
00:15:14,440 --> 00:15:15,510
thinking she was dead,

235
00:15:15,510 --> 00:15:17,170
why didn't they just

236
00:15:17,170 --> 00:15:18,500
throw her into the river?

237
00:15:18,500 --> 00:15:19,860
Wouldn't that make it easier to clean up

238
00:15:19,860 --> 00:15:21,290
the traces at the scene?

239
00:15:21,510 --> 00:15:22,600
About what you said,

240
00:15:22,600 --> 00:15:23,890
we spent a lot of

241
00:15:23,890 --> 00:15:26,550
manpower and resources
investigating it back then.

242
00:15:26,550 --> 00:15:27,950
We didn't find anything.

243
00:15:28,250 --> 00:15:29,270
Anything else?

244
00:15:30,380 --> 00:15:31,180
Yes, there is.

245
00:15:35,150 --> 00:15:36,440
As for these 2 photos,

246
00:15:35,220 --> 00:15:36,380
[Case Report]

247
00:15:36,440 --> 00:15:37,770
one was taken 8 years ago,

248
00:15:37,680 --> 00:15:38,640
[Chen Chunli Crime Scene Traces]
[Reconstructed Scene Traces]

249
00:15:37,790 --> 00:15:39,250
and the other last night.

250
00:15:39,270 --> 00:15:40,750
Last night, the four of us

251
00:15:40,750 --> 00:15:42,370
reconstructed the crime process

252
00:15:42,370 --> 00:15:44,470
at Chen Chunli's crime scene.

253
00:15:44,550 --> 00:15:45,560
We found that

254
00:15:45,340 --> 00:15:47,890
[Case Report]

255
00:15:45,590 --> 00:15:48,520
the traces there were very different
from back then.

256
00:15:49,550 --> 00:15:51,130
Do you have clearer ones?

257
00:15:51,170 --> 00:15:51,790
Yes.

258
00:15:53,170 --> 00:15:55,170
Chen Chunli reported the case
late at night.

259
00:15:53,730 --> 00:15:55,050
[Case Report] [Chen Chunli's Footprints]

260
00:15:55,200 --> 00:15:57,020
The police were dispatched immediately

261
00:15:57,020 --> 00:15:58,410
and arrived at the scene
in less than 2 hours

262
00:15:58,020 --> 00:15:59,070
[Chen Chunli's Footprints]

263
00:15:58,440 --> 00:15:59,460
after the incident.

264
00:15:59,460 --> 00:16:00,340
It wasn't dawn yet,

265
00:16:00,340 --> 00:16:03,150
so it was unlikely the scene
was destroyed by pedestrians.

266
00:16:03,150 --> 00:16:05,920
So there weren't many
interfering footprints.

267
00:16:05,980 --> 00:16:08,050
Judging from the photos
of the scene investigation,

268
00:16:08,050 --> 00:16:09,750
apart from Chen Chunli's footprints,

269
00:16:09,290 --> 00:16:11,280
[Chen Chunli's Footprints]

270
00:16:09,820 --> 00:16:11,700
there were 2 sets of
suspicious footprints,

271
00:16:11,700 --> 00:16:12,670
not 3.

272
00:16:12,690 --> 00:16:14,120
This doesn't match Chen Chunli's statement

273
00:16:14,120 --> 00:16:16,100
that there were 3 suspects.

274
00:16:16,530 --> 00:16:17,550
Moreover...

275
00:16:18,640 --> 00:16:20,400
by comparing the 2 sets of photos,

276
00:16:18,690 --> 00:16:23,200
[Chen Chunli Crime Scene Traces]
[Reconstructed Scene Traces]

277
00:16:20,430 --> 00:16:21,860
there were no obvious signs of struggle

278
00:16:21,860 --> 00:16:23,390
in the ones from 8 years ago.

279
00:16:23,410 --> 00:16:24,140
Right.

280
00:16:24,360 --> 00:16:26,080
The signs of struggle were even lighter

281
00:16:26,080 --> 00:16:27,940
than those from our reconstruction.

282
00:16:27,940 --> 00:16:30,940
I suggest separating the cases
and reinvestigating.

283
00:16:31,630 --> 00:16:32,820
Investigate the Chen Chunli Case?

284
00:16:32,820 --> 00:16:33,980
And the Du Juan Case.

285
00:16:36,120 --> 00:16:37,860
Oh my god.

286
00:16:38,790 --> 00:16:39,630
We still have no clue

287
00:16:39,630 --> 00:16:41,860
about the Heishuitan Case.

288
00:16:43,370 --> 00:16:44,580
One is dead.

289
00:16:44,750 --> 00:16:47,530
One is in the ICU,
whose life or death is uncertain,

290
00:16:47,530 --> 00:16:49,700
and we don't even know if he'll wake up.

291
00:16:52,860 --> 00:16:54,460
What do you think, Guangwen?

292
00:16:54,460 --> 00:16:55,920
Li Cheng's line of thought

293
00:16:56,270 --> 00:16:58,860
is actually consistent with
Zhao's back then.

294
00:16:58,860 --> 00:17:01,320
Zhao Ganzhe said something at the time.

295
00:17:01,700 --> 00:17:03,070
He said the Chen Chunli Case

296
00:17:03,070 --> 00:17:05,619
was like an inductive summary speech.

297
00:17:05,900 --> 00:17:08,050
It gave a standard answer

298
00:17:08,109 --> 00:17:10,089
just when our police were struggling.

299
00:17:08,390 --> 00:17:10,250
[Case Report]

300
00:17:11,510 --> 00:17:13,200
That's also why I insisted
on separating the cases

301
00:17:13,200 --> 00:17:15,220
and reinvestigating the Chen Chunli

302
00:17:15,220 --> 00:17:16,550
and Du Juan Cases.

303
00:17:20,530 --> 00:17:23,849
[Benteng Internet Cafe]

304
00:17:23,960 --> 00:17:24,700
[Heroes Assemble]

305
00:17:50,740 --> 00:17:51,750
Mr. Han.

306
00:17:52,770 --> 00:17:53,770
Here's the thing.

307
00:17:54,000 --> 00:17:56,750
Your equipment is too old.

308
00:17:56,750 --> 00:17:58,080
It's not worth much now.

309
00:17:58,250 --> 00:18:00,050
And the internet cafe licenses
are no longer restricted.

310
00:18:00,050 --> 00:18:01,160
They're nothing special.

311
00:18:01,160 --> 00:18:03,180
As for the property...

312
00:18:04,230 --> 00:18:05,430
the location is okay,

313
00:18:05,450 --> 00:18:06,650
but it's just too old.

314
00:18:08,990 --> 00:18:09,920
Name your price.

315
00:18:12,940 --> 00:18:15,330
Thirty. We'll cover the taxes.

316
00:18:15,450 --> 00:18:17,740
Forty. I'll handle the taxes myself.

317
00:18:18,570 --> 00:18:19,820
I'm afraid that's...

318
00:18:24,090 --> 00:18:25,680
How about this? Thirty-three,

319
00:18:25,680 --> 00:18:27,140
and we'll cover the taxes.

320
00:18:27,290 --> 00:18:29,590
Thirty-five, and you cover the taxes.

321
00:18:37,890 --> 00:18:38,560
Deal.

322
00:18:39,680 --> 00:18:40,660
Did you bring the contract?

323
00:18:40,660 --> 00:18:41,610
Are you in that much of a hurry?

324
00:18:41,610 --> 00:18:43,610
How about I treat you to a meal later?

325
00:18:45,630 --> 00:18:46,680
I brought it.

326
00:18:47,330 --> 00:18:50,090
Once signed and stamped,
the contract takes effect.

327
00:18:50,090 --> 00:18:51,550
When will the money land in my account?

328
00:18:51,550 --> 00:18:52,610
I need it urgently.

329
00:18:54,000 --> 00:18:54,830
How urgent?

330
00:18:55,060 --> 00:18:56,070
Very urgent.

331
00:18:56,700 --> 00:18:57,720
I can't wait.

332
00:18:59,610 --> 00:19:01,610
Okay. I'll do it as soon as possible.

333
00:19:20,440 --> 00:19:23,350
Isn't Xiaofei's birthday coming up soon?

334
00:19:23,350 --> 00:19:24,500
I was thinking of

335
00:19:24,500 --> 00:19:26,550
sending them something.

336
00:19:28,090 --> 00:19:29,570
Now is not the time.

337
00:19:35,010 --> 00:19:37,010
What have you been busy with lately?

338
00:19:37,200 --> 00:19:38,920
Were those 2 guys just now

339
00:19:39,250 --> 00:19:41,440
here to buy your internet cafe?

340
00:19:44,090 --> 00:19:44,870
Ms. Chen,

341
00:19:45,790 --> 00:19:48,110
I know what I'm doing.

342
00:19:48,250 --> 00:19:49,510
Don't worry about it.

343
00:19:52,890 --> 00:19:53,780
A month.

344
00:19:54,450 --> 00:19:55,670
A month at most,

345
00:19:56,010 --> 00:19:57,420
and it will all be over.

346
00:20:01,720 --> 00:20:03,530
What exactly are you planning?

347
00:20:04,530 --> 00:20:05,960
Why a month?

348
00:20:08,890 --> 00:20:10,150
After all these years,

349
00:20:10,400 --> 00:20:11,960
you still don't trust me.

350
00:20:14,550 --> 00:20:15,310
Yes.

351
00:20:39,090 --> 00:20:41,050
You need water to take your pills.

352
00:20:41,790 --> 00:20:43,270
Don't swallow them dry.

353
00:20:46,160 --> 00:20:47,050
Thank you.

354
00:20:51,330 --> 00:20:53,130
Your jaundice is so severe.

355
00:20:53,320 --> 00:20:54,410
Liver disease?

356
00:20:54,920 --> 00:20:56,630
You can tell?

357
00:20:56,920 --> 00:20:58,400
I used to be a caregiver.

358
00:20:58,420 --> 00:21:00,480
I've taken care of patients like you.

359
00:21:01,180 --> 00:21:02,660
You have a good eye.

360
00:21:14,200 --> 00:21:15,540
Tell me the truth.

361
00:21:16,010 --> 00:21:17,670
Are you in some kind of danger?

362
00:21:23,400 --> 00:21:24,460
I knew it.

363
00:21:27,610 --> 00:21:29,070
What happened 8 years ago

364
00:21:30,000 --> 00:21:31,900
won't pass so easily.

365
00:21:49,790 --> 00:21:50,680
Back then,

366
00:21:52,240 --> 00:21:53,500
I was the one...

367
00:21:55,900 --> 00:21:57,700
who led everyone into a dead end.

368
00:21:58,680 --> 00:21:59,530
I admit...

369
00:22:02,740 --> 00:22:03,720
I made a mistake.

370
00:22:06,090 --> 00:22:07,540
If you can separate

371
00:22:08,920 --> 00:22:10,120
the cases,

372
00:22:10,640 --> 00:22:12,550
it might be a good opportunity.

373
00:22:16,140 --> 00:22:17,720
First time hearing you admit

374
00:22:17,720 --> 00:22:19,180
your own faults.

375
00:22:25,760 --> 00:22:26,610
Xin.

376
00:22:28,110 --> 00:22:29,030
I don't think

377
00:22:29,140 --> 00:22:31,390
you were wrong back then.

378
00:22:31,510 --> 00:22:33,610
Times have just changed.

379
00:22:33,740 --> 00:22:36,180
Look at what we have in our hands now.

380
00:22:36,200 --> 00:22:38,000
It's different, isn't it?

381
00:22:41,010 --> 00:22:42,030
I have to say,

382
00:22:42,030 --> 00:22:43,980
Li Cheng is quite something.

383
00:22:44,080 --> 00:22:46,110
Smart and bold.

384
00:22:46,770 --> 00:22:47,880
Ever since that kid came,

385
00:22:47,880 --> 00:22:49,640
I've felt energized.

386
00:22:54,770 --> 00:22:55,850
Lately,

387
00:22:56,750 --> 00:22:58,480
I've been getting this feeling
more and more.

388
00:22:58,480 --> 00:23:00,200
We can go to Zhao's grave soon

389
00:23:00,200 --> 00:23:01,400
and tell him that

390
00:23:01,670 --> 00:23:03,900
the 3/12 Case he investigated for 8 years

391
00:23:03,900 --> 00:23:05,360
is about to have good news.

392
00:23:07,720 --> 00:23:09,180
Don't count your chickens

393
00:23:09,440 --> 00:23:10,750
before they hatch.

394
00:23:10,850 --> 00:23:11,850
It's still early.

395
00:23:17,050 --> 00:23:19,070
You, uh, pay for this.

396
00:23:21,700 --> 00:23:23,450
Wait, Xin, where are you going?

397
00:23:24,180 --> 00:23:26,610
Why are you being so elusive again?
Look at you.

398
00:23:26,610 --> 00:23:29,270
[Criminal Investigation Brigade
of Huangshui Public Security Bureau]

399
00:23:29,070 --> 00:23:31,160
It's the perfect chance
to catch the suspect.

400
00:23:31,160 --> 00:23:32,290
You really have to help us

401
00:23:32,290 --> 00:23:34,290
think back carefully.

402
00:23:34,770 --> 00:23:35,330
When Xu Ling

403
00:23:35,330 --> 00:23:37,160
and I went to investigate Chen Chunli,

404
00:23:37,160 --> 00:23:38,350
she was very resistant.

405
00:23:38,350 --> 00:23:41,350
Was it post-traumatic stress disorder
or something?

406
00:23:44,270 --> 00:23:46,260
There are 7 people on the list in total.

407
00:23:45,130 --> 00:23:46,080
[Qidu Public Security Bureau]
[Population Service Management Center]

408
00:23:46,330 --> 00:23:48,270
One of the names must be made up.

409
00:23:48,270 --> 00:23:49,700
It doesn't match the description.

410
00:23:49,700 --> 00:23:51,830
And the person isn't a migrant worker.

411
00:24:04,500 --> 00:24:06,010
That day, after unloading the goods,

412
00:24:06,010 --> 00:24:07,960
I was exhausted.

413
00:24:07,960 --> 00:24:09,550
Then, as I was walking slowly,

414
00:24:09,550 --> 00:24:11,550
someone suddenly jumped out of the bushes.

415
00:24:11,550 --> 00:24:13,240
I looked, and she was still moving.

416
00:24:13,240 --> 00:24:14,000
I pulled the handbrake

417
00:24:14,000 --> 00:24:15,900
and carried her into the truck.

418
00:24:16,110 --> 00:24:17,810
[3/12 Chen Chunli Case]
[Reconstructed Scene]

419
00:24:20,970 --> 00:24:22,270
[Fight Traces]
[Is there a third person?]

420
00:24:24,960 --> 00:24:27,010
Up ahead is their staff dormitory.

421
00:24:27,140 --> 00:24:29,240
The crime scene was right there.

422
00:24:32,080 --> 00:24:33,580
The entire technical school

423
00:24:33,580 --> 00:24:35,780
only had one camera there.

424
00:24:36,650 --> 00:24:38,030
This surveillance camera captures

425
00:24:38,030 --> 00:24:39,160
the scene from exactly this angle.

426
00:24:39,160 --> 00:24:40,440
And the back of the suspect

427
00:24:40,440 --> 00:24:41,480
in the photo was captured

428
00:24:41,480 --> 00:24:42,680
exactly from this angle.

429
00:24:42,680 --> 00:24:45,140
He climbed over this iron fence
and ran away.

430
00:25:19,490 --> 00:25:22,350
[Cheng]

431
00:25:34,440 --> 00:25:35,010
Hello?

432
00:25:35,010 --> 00:25:37,180
Cheng, it's Ms. Lin.

433
00:25:38,560 --> 00:25:39,490
Ms. Lin.

434
00:25:39,980 --> 00:25:42,740
You told me last time
that you're a police officer now,

435
00:25:42,740 --> 00:25:45,070
and that I should come to you
if I need help.

436
00:25:45,220 --> 00:25:47,140
I really ran into something.

437
00:25:47,200 --> 00:25:50,000
After thinking about it,
I have to tell you.

438
00:25:51,120 --> 00:25:52,820
What is it, Ms. Lin?

439
00:25:54,550 --> 00:25:57,050
Someone left money at my door.

440
00:25:59,900 --> 00:26:01,170
Who left it?

441
00:26:01,400 --> 00:26:02,590
I don't know.

442
00:26:02,790 --> 00:26:04,160
It was just left at our door.

443
00:26:04,160 --> 00:26:05,770
I saw a cloth bag,

444
00:26:06,200 --> 00:26:07,550
but I didn't see anyone.

445
00:26:09,030 --> 00:26:09,900
How much?

446
00:26:10,000 --> 00:26:11,070
100,000.

447
00:26:11,460 --> 00:26:12,500
100,000?

448
00:26:22,180 --> 00:26:23,230
Mr. Li.

449
00:26:27,870 --> 00:26:31,780
[Captain's Office]

450
00:26:32,750 --> 00:26:33,640
Sorry,

451
00:26:33,640 --> 00:26:36,500
the number you dialed
is temporarily unavailable.

452
00:26:40,610 --> 00:26:41,680
Captain Fan, we have a situation.

453
00:26:41,680 --> 00:26:42,350
Wait a minute.

454
00:26:42,350 --> 00:26:43,310
Have a seat.

455
00:26:43,330 --> 00:26:45,390
Okay, okay, I got it.

456
00:26:47,620 --> 00:26:48,880
You're just in time.

457
00:26:48,910 --> 00:26:50,300
I was looking for you.

458
00:26:50,980 --> 00:26:52,840
Something happened to Han Pinmu.

459
00:26:53,030 --> 00:26:54,030
What happened?

460
00:26:54,080 --> 00:26:55,540
He's in the hospital now.

461
00:26:56,460 --> 00:26:58,270
Has his liver cancer worsened?

462
00:26:58,270 --> 00:26:59,010
No,

463
00:26:59,220 --> 00:27:00,680
someone tried to kill him.

464
00:27:01,790 --> 00:27:03,020
Is he dead?

465
00:27:03,040 --> 00:27:04,400
Where is the crime scene?

466
00:27:04,400 --> 00:27:07,040
He's not dead.
The crime scene is at his home.

467
00:27:07,340 --> 00:27:08,750
There's another thing.

468
00:27:09,690 --> 00:27:10,750
There's a witness.

469
00:27:11,810 --> 00:27:13,660
The attacker might be...

470
00:27:16,070 --> 00:27:17,220
Xin Jiran.

471
00:27:19,920 --> 00:27:20,770
Where is he?

472
00:27:21,450 --> 00:27:22,390
He ran away.

473
00:27:43,660 --> 00:27:45,900
I heard him banging on the door.

474
00:27:45,900 --> 00:27:47,700
The whole building must have heard it.

475
00:27:47,700 --> 00:27:50,000
He was so aggressive.
They must have a deep grudge.

476
00:27:50,000 --> 00:27:52,250
I peeked through the peephole.

477
00:27:52,290 --> 00:27:53,030
Even through the door,

478
00:27:53,030 --> 00:27:54,530
I was scared to death.

479
00:27:54,530 --> 00:27:57,510
I saw him holding an axe.

480
00:27:57,530 --> 00:27:58,380
Wait.

481
00:27:59,550 --> 00:28:00,590
An axe?

482
00:28:01,030 --> 00:28:01,900
Are you sure?

483
00:28:01,900 --> 00:28:03,090
Pretty much.

484
00:28:03,110 --> 00:28:04,900
-I peeked through the peephole, anyway.
-Han Pinmu!

485
00:28:04,900 --> 00:28:07,040
-He carried a black thing on his right.
-Open the door!

486
00:28:07,040 --> 00:28:08,210
If it wasn't an axe,

487
00:28:08,240 --> 00:28:09,590
it was a weapon.

488
00:28:09,630 --> 00:28:10,390
Otherwise,

489
00:28:10,420 --> 00:28:12,020
how could that person faint?

490
00:28:12,020 --> 00:28:13,510
Just tell us what you're sure of.

491
00:28:13,510 --> 00:28:14,700
Don't guess.

492
00:28:15,170 --> 00:28:16,230
What time did he smash the door?

493
00:28:16,230 --> 00:28:17,610
In the middle of the night.

494
00:28:17,610 --> 00:28:19,550
Probably almost 12:00.

495
00:28:19,570 --> 00:28:20,840
What time did you call the police?

496
00:28:20,840 --> 00:28:22,290
After he went in,

497
00:28:22,740 --> 00:28:24,460
about 10 minutes later.

498
00:28:24,480 --> 00:28:25,430
Is this the man?

499
00:28:26,530 --> 00:28:27,640
Yes, that's him.

500
00:28:27,640 --> 00:28:29,400
You only saw his back
through the peephole.

501
00:28:29,400 --> 00:28:30,790
How can you be sure it's him?

502
00:28:30,790 --> 00:28:33,140
He told me to call an ambulance.

503
00:28:33,160 --> 00:28:35,430
He said someone fainted inside.

504
00:28:37,850 --> 00:28:38,610
Well,

505
00:28:38,610 --> 00:28:41,430
I was just passing by.

506
00:28:41,920 --> 00:28:42,980
Call an ambulance.

507
00:28:44,000 --> 00:28:45,420
Someone fainted inside.

508
00:28:45,610 --> 00:28:46,850
When he came out,

509
00:28:46,850 --> 00:28:48,070
was he carrying anything?

510
00:28:48,070 --> 00:28:50,020
No, he left empty-handed.

511
00:28:51,200 --> 00:28:52,940
What was the situation
in the room at that time?

512
00:28:52,940 --> 00:28:53,920
In the room,

513
00:28:54,530 --> 00:28:56,070
there was money all over the floor.

514
00:28:56,070 --> 00:28:57,030
All bright pink.

515
00:28:57,050 --> 00:28:58,820
Like a carpet.

516
00:28:59,140 --> 00:29:01,260
That person was lying
on the pile of money,

517
00:29:01,260 --> 00:29:03,270
just like now.

518
00:29:05,460 --> 00:29:07,440
Well, Officers,

519
00:29:07,440 --> 00:29:09,180
I'm an honest person.

520
00:29:09,180 --> 00:29:10,810
I didn't take a single bill.

521
00:29:12,160 --> 00:29:14,250
Do you know the resident here?

522
00:29:14,280 --> 00:29:15,100
Yes.

523
00:29:15,120 --> 00:29:17,510
But he doesn't come back often.

524
00:29:17,610 --> 00:29:19,350
We've bumped into each other a few times.

525
00:29:19,350 --> 00:29:21,350
Well, but we're not close.

526
00:29:21,400 --> 00:29:22,590
Really.

527
00:29:24,220 --> 00:29:25,570
Okay, that's all for now.

528
00:29:25,570 --> 00:29:26,610
If we need anything else,

529
00:29:26,610 --> 00:29:27,720
we'll come to you.

530
00:29:28,240 --> 00:29:28,940
Okay.

531
00:29:34,810 --> 00:29:35,590
Hu Sen, speak.

532
00:29:35,590 --> 00:29:37,140
It's confirmed. It's Xin Jiran.

533
00:29:37,140 --> 00:29:38,740
He entered the residential compound

534
00:29:38,740 --> 00:29:39,960
at 11:55 p.m. that night.

535
00:29:39,960 --> 00:29:41,310
At 11:59,

536
00:29:41,310 --> 00:29:43,400
he appeared near Han Pinmu's
apartment building.

537
00:29:43,400 --> 00:29:44,590
The camera inside the building was broken

538
00:29:44,590 --> 00:29:45,880
and had never been fixed.

539
00:29:45,880 --> 00:29:46,880
At 12:18,

540
00:29:46,880 --> 00:29:48,500
he left the compound and headed east.

541
00:29:48,500 --> 00:29:49,550
Did he bring anything?

542
00:29:49,550 --> 00:29:50,480
He brought

543
00:29:50,480 --> 00:29:51,510
a black plastic bag

544
00:29:51,510 --> 00:29:52,350
with something inside when he came.

545
00:29:52,350 --> 00:29:54,090
He left empty-handed.

546
00:29:54,110 --> 00:29:54,810
Okay.

547
00:29:54,940 --> 00:29:58,340
Keep checking for suspicious individuals
around that time.

548
00:30:06,220 --> 00:30:07,160
It seems

549
00:30:07,210 --> 00:30:09,210
the black bag he was carrying

550
00:30:09,380 --> 00:30:11,570
contained this money.

551
00:30:13,130 --> 00:30:14,700
Scattered all over the floor like this,

552
00:30:14,700 --> 00:30:16,030
it must be nearly 100,000.

553
00:30:16,030 --> 00:30:18,230
He struggles to even afford a full meal.

554
00:30:18,500 --> 00:30:20,970
Where did he get
such a large sum of money?

555
00:30:20,990 --> 00:30:23,350
Why leave it at Han Pinmu's place?

556
00:30:23,780 --> 00:30:25,370
More importantly,

557
00:30:25,780 --> 00:30:26,850
where did he go?

558
00:30:42,310 --> 00:30:45,290
The preliminary results from the
Forensics Department are out.

559
00:30:45,290 --> 00:30:47,850
The cash scattered on the floor
totals 100,000.

560
00:30:45,650 --> 00:30:46,010
[Huangshui County Public Security
Forensic Science Center]

561
00:30:46,030 --> 00:30:46,440
[Trace Examination
and Identification Report]

562
00:30:48,200 --> 00:30:49,070
The fingerprints extracted from the money

563
00:30:49,070 --> 00:30:51,000
all belong to Xin Jiran and Han Pinmu.

564
00:30:51,000 --> 00:30:51,830
And the bloodstains on the floor

565
00:30:51,830 --> 00:30:52,830
have been confirmed by DNA matching

566
00:30:52,830 --> 00:30:54,420
to belong to Han Pinmu.

567
00:30:54,270 --> 00:30:54,720
[Fingerprint A recovered from banknotes
at Han Pinmu's place]

568
00:30:54,660 --> 00:30:56,270
However, because the traces at the scene
are too widely distributed,

569
00:30:54,750 --> 00:30:55,200
[matches the rolled fingerprint sample A1
of Xin Jiran.]

570
00:30:56,270 --> 00:30:58,330
a large amount of physical evidence
still needs further examination.

571
00:30:58,330 --> 00:30:59,830
What's the situation at the hospital?

572
00:30:59,830 --> 00:31:01,810
Han Pinmu suffered a heavy blow
to the head with a blunt object,

573
00:31:01,810 --> 00:31:03,720
resulting in a depressed skull fracture.

574
00:31:03,720 --> 00:31:05,070
He is currently out of danger

575
00:31:05,070 --> 00:31:06,830
but remains in a coma.

576
00:31:06,830 --> 00:31:08,380
Our people are taking turns guarding him
at the hospital.

577
00:31:08,380 --> 00:31:10,200
As soon as there are signs
that he might wake up,

578
00:31:10,200 --> 00:31:12,250
the task force will be notified
immediately.

579
00:31:12,250 --> 00:31:13,810
So this is the situation right now—

580
00:31:13,810 --> 00:31:16,010
Xin Jiran entered Han Pinmu's home

581
00:31:16,010 --> 00:31:17,380
with a bag of money.

582
00:31:17,850 --> 00:31:18,910
Ten minutes later,

583
00:31:19,000 --> 00:31:21,290
Han Pinmu was struck hard and fainted.

584
00:31:21,790 --> 00:31:23,330
The scene was covered with money,

585
00:31:23,330 --> 00:31:25,420
and then Xin Jiran disappeared.

586
00:31:25,440 --> 00:31:26,100
Right?

587
00:31:26,850 --> 00:31:28,940
Now, I need answers to 3 questions.

588
00:31:29,000 --> 00:31:30,680
First, the source of this money.

589
00:31:30,680 --> 00:31:32,400
Second, what exactly happened

590
00:31:32,400 --> 00:31:33,740
during those 10 minutes?

591
00:31:33,740 --> 00:31:35,530
Third, and, of course,
the most important one,

592
00:31:35,530 --> 00:31:37,460
where is Xin Jiran now?

593
00:31:40,000 --> 00:31:41,680
Captain Fan, regarding the money,

594
00:31:41,680 --> 00:31:42,680
there's something

595
00:31:42,680 --> 00:31:44,500
I haven't had the chance to report.

596
00:31:44,500 --> 00:31:46,160
This morning I received a call

597
00:31:46,160 --> 00:31:47,480
from Bi Dehua's mother, Lin Guizhi.

598
00:31:47,480 --> 00:31:48,680
She said she found

599
00:31:48,680 --> 00:31:50,140
100,000 yuan of unknown origin

600
00:31:50,140 --> 00:31:51,220
at her doorstep.

601
00:31:51,440 --> 00:31:52,750
Where is the money now?

602
00:31:53,050 --> 00:31:54,580
I told her to keep it for now.

603
00:31:55,130 --> 00:31:57,560
Bi Dehua is a suspect in the 3/12 Case,

604
00:31:57,640 --> 00:31:59,310
and Xin Xiaoliang also died indirectly

605
00:31:59,310 --> 00:32:00,190
because of the 3/12 Case.

606
00:32:00,190 --> 00:32:01,290
Now the families of both

607
00:32:01,290 --> 00:32:03,160
have received large sums of unknown money.

608
00:32:03,160 --> 00:32:04,760
Could this be a coincidence?

609
00:32:05,140 --> 00:32:06,810
Why are they handing money away?

610
00:32:06,810 --> 00:32:07,810
A while ago,

611
00:32:07,810 --> 00:32:09,740
Han Pinmu sold his internet cafe.

612
00:32:09,760 --> 00:32:10,750
I asked around.

613
00:32:10,770 --> 00:32:12,430
It sold for a total of 350,000.

614
00:32:12,510 --> 00:32:14,910
Could it be related to
these 2 sums of money?

615
00:32:16,480 --> 00:32:18,720
What reason would he have to give money
to these 2 people?

616
00:32:18,720 --> 00:32:20,490
Maybe it's guilt.

617
00:32:20,550 --> 00:32:22,110
He feels guilty about the deaths

618
00:32:22,110 --> 00:32:23,240
of Xin Xiaoliang and Bi Dehua,

619
00:32:23,240 --> 00:32:24,570
so he's making up for it.

620
00:32:24,900 --> 00:32:25,640
But Bi Dehua

621
00:32:25,640 --> 00:32:28,770
is a suspect in the 5th case,
Chen Chunli Case.

622
00:32:28,900 --> 00:32:30,940
How is he connected to Han Pinmu?

623
00:32:32,240 --> 00:32:34,220
Speaking of the 3/12 Case,

624
00:32:34,290 --> 00:32:35,830
we still haven't figured out

625
00:32:35,830 --> 00:32:39,090
the real identity of the person
impersonating Song Laifu.

626
00:32:44,550 --> 00:32:45,310
What else?

627
00:32:48,820 --> 00:32:50,220
Why is everyone so quiet?

628
00:32:51,860 --> 00:32:52,980
Cheer up, everyone!

629
00:32:52,980 --> 00:32:53,850
Do you hear me?

630
00:32:54,680 --> 00:32:55,400
Yang Feng, Xu Ling,

631
00:32:55,400 --> 00:32:56,660
go check the source of the money.

632
00:32:56,660 --> 00:32:57,330
Yes.

633
00:32:57,480 --> 00:32:58,450
Hu Sen, Wang Tao.

634
00:32:59,460 --> 00:33:01,810
Try to make a breakthrough in
the impersonator's true identity.

635
00:33:01,810 --> 00:33:03,010
Guangwen, Li Cheng.

636
00:33:03,590 --> 00:33:04,680
Find Xin Jiran

637
00:33:04,680 --> 00:33:06,030
no matter what it takes!

638
00:33:06,030 --> 00:33:06,900
-Yes!
-Yes!

639
00:33:17,880 --> 00:33:18,550
Sorry,

640
00:33:18,740 --> 00:33:21,070
the subscriber you dialed is powered off.

641
00:33:22,610 --> 00:33:26,040
[To Big Red Date]

642
00:33:23,010 --> 00:33:24,880
Where are you? Call me back ASAP.

643
00:34:30,239 --> 00:34:31,590
Li Cheng.

644
00:34:34,010 --> 00:34:35,780
This is for you.

645
00:35:06,110 --> 00:35:08,260
You came to see a dying patient

646
00:35:08,990 --> 00:35:11,420
empty-handed, without even bringing

647
00:35:11,450 --> 00:35:13,180
flowers or fruits?

648
00:35:14,380 --> 00:35:15,760
You want to turn yourself in.

649
00:35:15,760 --> 00:35:17,190
For which crime?
